    offerings, as a one-time lifetime purchase. the plans available to you, their exact price, their length and any free
    trial are shown on the purchase screen before you confirm, and payment is charged to your app store or google play
    account at confirmation.
  </p>
  <p>
    an auto-renewable subscription renews for the same period at the same price unless it is cancelled at least 24 hours
    before the end of the current period; the renewal is charged within the 24 hours before the period ends. you can
    manage or cancel a subscription in your store account settings at any time — on iphone or ipad, in
    <em>settings → your name → subscriptions</em>. deleting the app does not cancel a subscription.
  </p>
  <p>
